    <div class="faq-section reveal">
      <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:20px">FAQ</div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">What is the minimum order amount?</span><span class="faq-icon fas fa-plus"></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">There is no minimum order amount. However, orders above ₹499 qualify for free delivery. Below that, a flat ₹40 delivery fee applies.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How long does delivery take?</span><span class="faq-icon fas fa-plus"></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Our average delivery time is 25–30 minutes. For late-night orders or peak hours, it may take up to 40 minutes. You can track your order in real-time after placing it.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Are there vegan or gluten-free options?</span><span class="faq-icon fas fa-plus"></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Yes! We have several plant-based options including our Veg Portobello Burger and Paneer Tikka Burger. Filter by 'Veg Only' in our menu. Contact us for specific allergen information.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">Can I modify my order after placing it?</span><span class="faq-icon fas fa-plus"></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Order modifications are possible within 2 minutes of placement. After that, the kitchen begins preparation. Please call us immediately at +91 9876543210 for urgent changes.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question"><span class="faq-question-text">How do coupon codes work?</span><span class="faq-icon fas fa-plus"></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">Enter your coupon code at checkout. Available codes: BLAZE50 (₹50 off), FIRST100 (₹100 off first order), MIDNIGHT (₹80 off after 11PM), VIP200 (₹200 off). One code per order.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact Form -->
    <div class="contact-form-section reveal">
      <div class="section-label" style="margin-bottom:20px">SEND A MESSAGE</div>
      <form class="contact-form-grid" id="contactForm">
        <div class="cf-group">
          <label>Your Name</label>
          <input type="text" class="cf-input" placeholder="Arjun Kumar" required>
        </div>
        <div class="cf-group">
          <label>Email Address</label>
          <input type="email" class="cf-input" placeholder="arjun@email.com" required>
        </div>
        <div class="cf-group">
